{"compatibility":{"main_project":">=0.1.0","notes":"plugin-ui 0.2.0 tightens preset validation in both SDK lanes: check-preset resolves the action from the preset's settings-schema identity and applies the canonical action schema plus the descriptor's input_constraints (an explicit --action forces one; a custom-$id schema applies no envelope and says so); check-ui validates every preset a configuration target declares and REFUSES a preset-shaped asset no target declares (unreferenced_preset) \u2014 packages valid under 0.1.1 with unreferenced preset assets are refused, so the bump is MINOR. RE-VERSION OBLIGATION: documents re-version to 0.2.0 (contract_version consts and schema $ids moved; the vendored tree is single-active-version so 0.1.1 documents no longer validate \u2014 the in-tree sim_scope plugin re-versioned in the same train). SDK behavior change rides the next release train as 0.0.x (version not bumped in this sync, precedent f5e05fa). Adapter API stays 1.1.","sdk":"0.0.2"},"lock_version":1,"standards":[{"files":[{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/device-profile-catalog.json","sha256":"dc776ec3dd02f3b37e02005f79434597f220b5acb5d6c23c98b844aa3e63d923"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/device-profile-catalog.schema.json","sha256":"ae14c1b220ba35b434a174439e704cdb066e189120aa4dd950d7b84964e62533"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/examples/class-action-vectors.json","sha256":"d0da525ae23a6067e76e35bd505260df5a1c124c1311a06c011c144f31f18b49"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/examples/class-daq.json","sha256":"26a0bff7d919e118d8448d628b37175664b13c0c5120c9f23bbe92342c9ef218"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/examples/class-dc_psu.json","sha256":"8121b4f69cb8870c3e5afc33a3b55b427dcc35b8f38bcc7a86be26c2f2ad66c8"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/examples/class-dmm.json","sha256":"efdecd0835fcdc41970096f33a923cb7aa3d876ec97b3bc5a6bd4611264d04f7"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/examples/class-electronic_load.json","sha256":"e932509456894b16a67b3e3023b26ee8c828db916dbd7fc1f5479b3a45115369"},{"path":"otdp/0.2.0/examples/class-embedded_controller.json","sha